Softimage Importer
==================

The native Softimage .scn/.emdl reader and native material adapter contain
code from Silica by Alex Doss:

    https://github.com/whoisit/silica
    Copyright (C) 2026 Alex Doss
    Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later

Those files retain their original SPDX and copyright notices. The Blender
adapter in this project is separate and does not include Silica's user
interface, keymap, theme, or workflow code.

The original dotXSI parser was informed by Autodesk's published Softimage and
Crosswalk SDK template definitions and was tested against public dotXSI files.
The Apache-2.0 TTO Softimage XSI Importer was reviewed as prior art; no source
code from it is included here.
